	<plagnioj@jcrosoft.com>, <richard.genoud@gmail.com>,
	<JM.Lin@atmel.com>, <wenyou.yang@atmel.com>,
	<spi-devel-general@lists.sourceforge.net>,
	<linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org>
To: <linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org>
